SUMMARY:[Bay/Free] East Bay’s Free Park Day on Green Friday 2026 (East B
 ay Regional Parks)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T210000
DTSTAMP:20261127T160306Z
UID:funcheap-20261127-eastbaysfreeparkdayongre
CATEGORIES:community,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/east-bay-park-districts-free-park-day/
 \nLocation: east bay\nPrice: Free\nCategories: community\, free\nSource: f
 uncheap/east-bay\n\noin us on Friday\, November 27\, 2026 for Green Friday
 \, a Free Park Day across the East Bay Regional Parks. Instead of hitting 
 the Black Friday shopping crowds\, spend the day outdoors with family and 
 friends\, exploring local trails\, joining a naturalist-led hike or pitchi
 ng in on a park improvement project. On Green Friday\, entrance and park u
 se fees are waived throughout the Regional Parks\, including parking\, hor
 seback riding\, boat launching and fishing\, as well as admission to Arden
 wood Historic Farm in Fremont. The fee waiver does not cover state fishing
  licenses\, watercraft inspections or concessions such as the Tilden Merry
 -Go-Round. The East Bay Regional Park District has celebrated Green Friday
  for more than 10 years\, encouraging visitors to skip the shopping and sp
 end the day enjoying nature. This year’s activities include guided hikes
  at Black Diamond Mines\, Reinhardt Redwood and Coyote Hills\, plus volunt
 eer planting projects in Antioch and Fremont. Find hikes and activities in
  the East Bay Regional Parks on Green Friday. Green Friday at the East Bay
  Regional Parks Black Diamond Green Friday Hike Friday\, Nov. 27\, 2026\, 
 9:00 AM Black Diamond Mines\, Antioch Drop-in Program Gre
LOCATION:east bay
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/east-bay-park-districts-free-park-day/
END:VEVENT
