 n\nSkip the conventional Black Friday madness and head to Crockett for Nig
 ht Trip\, Pomona Street’s last-Friday-of-the-month block party celebrati
 ng independent businesses\, music\, art and community. This month\, Monarc
 h presents a special free live performance by EnSpirits\, featuring the ex
 traordinary musical talents of Crockett’s own\, Dave Tweedie and Victori
 a Theodore. Catch this dynamic duo in an intimate setting from 7–9 PM at
  Monarch |1308 Pomona Street. Throughout the evening\, shops along Pomona 
 Street will remain open late\, pop-up vendors will line the street\, and S
 ol Haus will host a special “charm bar” event. Discover one-of-a-kind 
