 loring one of the East Bay’s most eclectic little towns. Friday\, Novemb
 er 27 Night Trip: 6–11 PM EnSpirits at Monarch: 7–9 PM 1308 Pomona Str
 eet\, Crockett\, CA Free show. All are welcome.
