BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Bay/Free] East Bay Open Studios 2026 (Dec 5-13)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T210000
DTSTAMP:20261127T160306Z
UID:funcheap-20261205-eastbayopenstudios2026de
CATEGORIES:community,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/east-bay-open-studios-2026-dec-513/\nV
 enue: it’s made\, and leave inspired. Just in time for the holidays\, it
 ’s also a wonder\nPrice: Free\nCategories: community\, free\nSource: fun
 cheap/east-bay\n\nEast Bay Open Studios returns for two free weekends with
  over 200 artists opening their studios to the public. This free\, self-gu
 ided event invites you to wander into local studios\, galleries\, and comm
 unity hubs in Oakland\, Berkeley\, and beyond. Come curious — meet the c
 reative minds behind the work\, experience art where it’s made\, and lea
 ve inspired. Just in time for the holidays\, it’s also a wonderful oppor
